[
 {
  "charId": 1352,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">身手不错，小子！<sbr />下次见面就是你的<sbr />死期，唔哈哈哈哈<sbr />哈！~~~</font></p>",
  "plainText": "身手不错，小子！下次见面就是你的死期，唔哈哈哈哈哈！~~~",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "59817d520f151489492405dde53a7c6ade6328b4647f5203fa0a8e72c58de1ab"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1354,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">他往B区去了，</font></p><p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">那边有飞船！</font></p><p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">他要逃走了！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "他往B区去了，那边有飞船！他要逃走了！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "c13fb448d9ae74cbfb416a84771f34e13e2180dcf3a5b4197663ee5b94027e09"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1356,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">Bloody，你休想<sbr />逃掉！我们追！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "Bloody，你休想逃掉！我们追！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "03f497856e7519c4e7b8960d254f302a2f34da970341ed9ad085a7dbc1479132"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1358,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">这里是Commander.M，<sbr />当地政府派出的空军已<sbr />经在研究所上空待机，<sbr />可随时听后差遣！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "这里是Commander.M，当地政府派出的空军已经在研究所上空待机，可随时听后差遣！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "e778c0f756214708a69e68bfd94cf7ccbe35679190609f14de8d503de2197e7c"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1360,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">呼叫Commander.M！C&amp;T组<sbr />织的头目Bloody逃走了，<sbr />我们正往研究所B-2区追<sbr />赶，请求空中支援！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "呼叫Commander.M！C&amp;T组织的头目Bloody逃走了，我们正往研究所B-2区追赶，请求空中支援！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "369d195a039fc4ed4ffe87e994543bb66d1550e9e0b75a0154cd8c9baf6f5d26"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1361,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">很好！我们已经到B-2<sbr />区飞船升降台了，让空<sbr />军紧跟在我们后面，<sbr />Bloody的飞船已经出来<sbr />了！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "很好！我们已经到B-2区飞船升降台了，让空军紧跟在我们后面，Bloody的飞船已经出来了！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "98fc43a2dd0a7f7e4ca72b25b8bcb19203b1edacfad7f35b1ae04daebfb259a3"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1363,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">没问题！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "没问题！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "e5175af1584cb24a31b95c2485a9ac3450772004dfd7060d7c6036624fa84529"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1365,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">报告长官！研究所的<sbr />资料已经摧毁了！拷<sbr />贝的备份我稍后会传<sbr />回基地。</font></p>",
  "plainText": "报告长官！研究所的资料已经摧毁了！拷贝的备份我稍后会传回基地。",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "6395f21b4adc51c745b7d37c872acbed30fdbb70235ba2bad0af066bd41d3652"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1369,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">干得好！Wings！<sbr />请继续全力协助<sbr />Andy Law，彻底<sbr />消灭Bloody<font face=\"Comic Sans MS\">！</font></font></p>",
  "plainText": "干得好！Wings！请继续全力协助Andy Law，彻底消灭Bloody！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "0db7faa6bfe8cae7b041488b39a1627debcd00adc76ff4c3fbec83fd92574329"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1371,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">哈哈哈！都跟过来吧！正好<sbr />让你们见识见识我的最终生<sbr />化武器的威力！你们都将成<sbr />为宇宙的尘埃！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "哈哈哈！都跟过来吧！正好让你们见识见识我的最终生化武器的威力！你们都将成为宇宙的尘埃！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "36a06e5893d8ccdf0dfc4d4c5a24b5309a4b029345c64600d421029e4e87ba03"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1373,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">原来Bloody的老巢在这里，<sbr />X-ZONE-33区域，原星际联盟<sbr />第一中转基地，WW-III第三<sbr />次世界大战后这里已经多年<sbr />无人使用了。</font></p>",
  "plainText": "原来Bloody的老巢在这里，X-ZONE-33区域，原星际联盟第一中转基地，WW-III第三次世界大战后这里已经多年无人使用了。",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "cc1016a103110de612e38dcb24645e4ea62ce3b77601e2e2789ccab87c88d3c9"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1375,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">支援舰队不要再往前了，<sbr />原地待命！我和Wings潜<sbr />入基地就可以了，这里人<sbr />多反而不好行动！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "支援舰队不要再往前了，原地待命！我和Wings潜入基地就可以了，这里人多反而不好行动！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "f2d200d2b06a183552c039cae69c4010a350b1cc919ca547d4ad08f43dcfef28"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1377,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">支援舰队<sbr />明白！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "支援舰队明白！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "83dd9902ad266e079f2cc304d8c7515ab7666f2df3be58c585581997ad3dde37"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1379,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">告诉基地，Roll <sbr />Phantom计划准备<sbr />启动！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "告诉基地，Roll Phantom计划准备启动！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "f7ac37ff0935c5b7b82f4bd3a8eeec5291caad8f8013550ed933671ba8a69bfa"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1381,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">基地明白！最终<sbr />生化武器激活倒<sbr />计时已开始！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "基地明白！最终生化武器激活倒计时已开始！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "6f251c9f558d83d88c5a212a6d3c41fade55dfb54d1df46c9fb0c6870ca076b8"
 },
 {
  "charId": 1382,
  "htmlOriginal": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"0\">是，长官！</font></p>",
  "plainText": "是，长官！",
  "fontId": 92,
  "bodySha256": "87e18cce9aa1aa98b6a17cddb06dc18587f9d565fc9129aa000a4f66a6ec2d0e"
 }
]
